# INDEX: CONTRACT

## Required

1. `project-rules/rules/domain_rules.md`
2. `project-rules/rules/operational_rules.md`

## On trigger

- `architecture_rules.md`: the contract change alters layers or dependencies.
- `error_handling_rules.md`: new error codes or failure flow in the contract.
- `security_rules.md`: payload with sensitive data or PII.

Load every triggered rule before the first edit, in batches of up to two.

## References

- `api_contract_reference.md`: format, example, or long contract.
- `project-rules/contracts/*.openapi.json`: REST contract — consult-only; do not mutate.
- Omit this section when there is no actionable reference.
